e II fit has chi2 per point 6.88 and weight 0.0018 versus 0.572 for Ia, showing it explains the data far worse than the rival model."}], "weights": {"ia": 0.7423, "ibc": 0.1272, "ii": 0.0007, "null": 0.1298}, "wording": {"term": "very unlikely", "text": "This distant space flash is very unlikely to still look bright in red light 5 days from now.", "words_match": true}}, "prev": "ca4843f4976ad36a5fc318bbac62826cc3d4e8b401244b517a989837938f3881", "seq": 10, "time": "2021-04-09T22:32:26+00:00", "v": 2}
